    "about": {
      "text": "Figure 4: the NRC property values read back from duplex-enriched.ifc, the file nrc-enrich-run writes. nrcOnly keeps the Pset_NRC sets and withStepId adds each entity's STEP id: 2,441 rows, one for each row nrc-enrich-run handed the byte-exact writer, in the writer's column names."
